// ⚠️ THIS NOTE IS AT THE FILE END ON PURPOSE. A comment ABOVE the music shifts every
// source offset after it, so the whole book's data-pos moves and its snapshot has to be
// re-based -- a diff that proves nothing and hides the next real one. Below the music,
// nothing moves.
// ✔ VERIFIED TO GUARD, not assumed to (session 286): reverting DynamicEngraver's
// dynMeasures to ResolveStaffMeasures -- the defect this book was written for -- moves
// this snapshot (the @f goes from x 19.29 back to x 11.78) and moves NO other snapshot
// of the 223, which is exactly why it had to be written.
